  the adapter's shipped-entrypoint boundary and the skill drift guard.
- t-harness-adapter-map: event-to-hook mapping through the adapter's runCore
  seam: guard blocks, batch task rewrites, subagent-only reviewer scope,
  execution-tool rules, nested subagent identity, sensor feedback.
- t-harness-hook-contracts: the shipped adapter driving the real hooks
  through the production dispatcher in a scratch project.
- t-harness-usage-reader: harness session usage, attribution and fold.
- t-rpc-harness-live (AIDLC_HARNESS_RPC_LIVE): real Coding Harness RPC turns
  with scripted ask answers through tests/harness/harness-rpc.ts; the
  harness live family is registered for local runs.
