+// t-harness-hook-contracts: the shipped Coding Harness adapter (dist/harness),
+// driven through synthetic harness events, runs the REAL core hooks through its
+// production dispatcher (`bun .harness-aidlc/tools/aidlc.ts engine hook <name>`)
+// in a scratch project. Each case asserts the consumer-visible effect: audit rows,
+// guard blocks reaching the tool call, sensor verdicts reaching the model, and the
+// Stop decision computed from a harness session transcript.
+//
+// covers: hook:aidlc-record-human-turn, hook:aidlc-plan-approval-guard, hook:aidlc-continue-workflow, hook:aidlc-run-sensors, hook:aidlc-reviewer-scope, hook:aidlc-review-freeze, function:isHarnessSessionTranscript
